flowchart LR
  R[Typed score request<br/>pseudonymous application reference<br/>feature map<br/>optional monitoring attributes] --> C[Feature contract<br/>required names<br/>unknown-name rejection<br/>numeric values<br/>fixed order]
  C --> S[Minimal sanitization<br/>payment rates to 0..1<br/>event counts nonnegative]
  S --> V[Vectorization<br/>required then optional<br/>missing optionals become 0.0]
  V --> M[Logistic model<br/>probability of good outcome]
  M --> P[Decision policy<br/>score compared with threshold]
  P --> RC[Heuristic reason codes<br/>up to four ranked conditions]
  M --> EX[Linear contribution proxy<br/>coefficient multiplied by raw value]
  P --> AE[Decision audit event<br/>tokenized ID, versions, feature hash]

  LIMIT[Current limitation:<br/>published UI ranges are not a complete backend rejection contract;<br/>reason and contribution fidelity require independent validation]:::risk

  classDef risk fill:#FCE1E0,stroke:#B3261E,color:#172B4D
